Start LTE PUSCH Performance Test
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts LTE PUSCH Performance Test via admin API. Version for TDD and FDD.

    [Arguments]  ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${earfcn_ul}
    ...          ${pusch_format}
    ...          ${reference_channel_number}
    ...          ${reporting_time_interval}
    ...          ${resource_block_offset}
    ...          ${nb_subcarrier_index}
    ...          ${measured_frc}
    ...          ${reference_channel_number_nb_linked}
    ...          ${local_cell_res_id_nb_linked}
    ...          ${inband_prb_index_ul}
    ...          ${guardband_index_ul}
    ...          ${nb_repetitions}
    ...          ${nb_subframe_offset}
    ...          ${reception_subframe}
    ...          ${exception_subframe}
    ...          ${reception_bundle}
    ...          ${expection_bundle}
    ...          ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...          ${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...          ${digital_output_type}
    ...          ${enable_harq}
    ...          ${enable_digital_output}
    ...          ${cell_technology}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${cell_type_to_print}
    ...          ${cell_id_to_print}
    ...          ${timeout}=60

    ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}                                   Set variable if
    ...                                                     "TDD" in """${cell_technology}"""
    ...                                                     ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     ${None}
    ${tdd_frame_conf}                                       Set variable if
    ...                                                     "TDD" in """${cell_technology}"""
    ...                                                     ${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     ${None}

    Robot log operation                                     Starting LTE PUSCH performance test on cell ID: ${cell_id_to_print}...
    ${start_test_result}                                    tm_lte_adm.start_lte_pusch_performance_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     earfcn=${earfcn_ul}
    ...                                                     pusch_format=${pusch_format}
    ...                                                     reference_channel_number=${reference_channel_number}
    ...                                                     reporting_time_interval=${reporting_time_interval}
    ...                                                     resource_block_offset=${resource_block_offset}
    ...                                                     nb_subcarrier_index=${nb_subcarrier_index}
    ...                                                     measured_frc=${measured_frc}
    ...                                                     tdd_spec_subf_conf=${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     tdd_frame_conf=${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     reference_channel_number_nb_linked=${reference_channel_number_nb_linked}
    ...                                                     local_cell_res_id_nb_linked=${local_cell_res_id_nb_linked}
    ...                                                     inband_prb_index_ul=${inband_prb_index_ul}
    ...                                                     guardband_index_ul=${guardband_index_ul}
    ...                                                     nb_repetitions=${nb_repetitions}
    ...                                                     nb_subframe_offset=${nb_subframe_offset}
    ...                                                     reception_subframe=${reception_subframe}
    ...                                                     exception_subframe=${exception_subframe}
    ...                                                     reception_bundle=${reception_bundle}
    ...                                                     expection_bundle=${expection_bundle}
    ...                                                     digital_output_type=${digital_output_type}
    ...                                                     enable_harq=${enable_harq}
    ...                                                     enable_digital_output=${enable_digital_output}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${start_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                     Succeeded
    ...                                                     msg=PUSCH performance test start failed on ${cell_type_to_print} cell (cell ID: ${cell_id_to_print}): ${start_test_result['msg']}
    Robot Log Step                                          PUSCH performance test has started successfully on ${cell_type_to_print} cell (cell ID: ${cell_id_to_print}).

