Get and Verify LTE PUSCH Performance Test Results
    [Arguments]  ${cell_id}
    ...          ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${nb_linked_cell}
    ...          ${pusch_format}
    ...          ${result_timeout}
    ...          ${reporting_time_interval}
    ...          ${connection}

    ${ccm_test}                                             Set variable if  """${pusch_format}"""=="""1"""
    ...                                                     ${False}
    ...                                                     ${True}

    Robot log operation                                     Getting LTE PUSCH performance results...
    ${test_results}                                         tm_lte_adm.get_lte_uplink_test_results
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     ccm_test=${ccm_test}
    ...                                                     finalizer_timeout=${result_timeout}
    ...                                                     timeout=${result_timeout}
    ...                                                     get_updates=${True}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${count_of_results_to_verify}                           Evaluate
    ...                                                     int(math.floor(${result_timeout}/${reporting_time_interval}))
    ...                                                     modules=math

    Robot log operation                                     Validating LTE PUSCH performance results...
    tm_lte_adm.verify_lte_uplink_test_results
    ...                                                     test_results=${test_results}
    ...                                                     count_of_results_to_verify=${count_of_results_to_verify}
    ...                                                     ccm_test=${ccm_test}
    ...                                                     nb_linked_cell=${nb_linked_cell}
    Robot Log Result                                        Results verification succeeded.
    ...                                                     console=${True}

